      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1776611965641,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "With the binomial\ndistribution we can\nmake out the overall\nprobability that the \nmajority chooses, and\nthis tend to perform\nbetter than the best\nmodel",
